  "body": "Set in a prime Bucklands Beach location, this freehold end-unit home offers the space, privacy and school zones families are looking for.\r\n\r\nFeaturing 3 bedrooms plus study, 2.5 bathrooms, 2 separate living areas and a separate laundry, the layout is practical, flexible and ideal for modern family living.\r\n\r\nBeing the last home in the development gives you added privacy, while the internal-access garage plus generous off-street parking means there is plenty of room for multiple vehicles and visitors.\r\n\r\nZoned for both Macleans College and Bucklands Beach Intermediate, with beaches, parks, shops and local amenities all close by.\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\n\r\nFreehold end unit\r\n3 bedrooms + study\r\n2.5 bathrooms\r\n2 separate living areas\r\nSeparate laundry\r\nInternal-access garage\r\nPlenty of off-street parking\r\nMacleans College and Bucklands Beach Intermediate zoned\r\nClose to beaches, parks and everyday amenities\r\n\r\nSpace, privacy, parking and premium school zones - all in one! Call us today before it's too late!",
